NAME
       du - estimate file space usage

SYNOPSIS
       du [-abchkmsxLPH0] [-d N] [--apparent-size] [file...]

DESCRIPTION
       Disk usage. Sizes come from stat: st_blocks (512-byte
       units) by default, st_size with --apparent-size or -b
       (a directory itself then counts 0, as in GNU du). Shown
       in 1024-byte units unless -b, -m or -h. Hard links are
       counted once. Directories are listed after their
       contents.

SEE ALSO
       sh(1)

